sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Collaborateur
    participant NG as Angular (SPA)
    participant API as Django / DRF
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over NG: session pharmacie déjà ouverte
    C->>NG: sélectionne son profil, saisit son PIN
    NG->>API: POST /api/team/login/ { collaborator_id, pin }
    API->>DB: charge le Collaborator
    alt PIN verrouillé (pin_locked_until > now)
        API-->>NG: 423 Locked (minutes restantes)
    else PIN incorrect
        API->>DB: register_pin_failure() (verrou à 5 échecs / 15 min)
        API->>DB: CollaboratorLoginLog(success=False)
        API-->>NG: 403 Forbidden
    else PIN correct
        API->>DB: reset_pin_failures()
        API->>API: AccessToken.for_user(pharmacy)<br/>claims: auth_type=collaborator, collaborator_id, can_*  (30 min, non renouvelable)
        API-->>NG: 200 { access } + Set-Cookie session_info
    end
